 ka gol oopar hota hai. Ab Bholu ne ghar ka number 6 ulta likha. Woh kehta hai, phir bhi chhah hai. Kya Bholu sahi hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi... sahi nahi hai, wo 9 ban jaayega na?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, Bholu sahi nahi hai. Ulta 6, 9 ban jaata hai. Ab do rotiyaan thi, tumne dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... kuch nahi bachi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, dono rotiyaan kha li, toh zero bachi. Ab cricket mein ek batsman bina run banaye out hua. Uska score kya hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero hoga na... bina run banaye out matlab kuch nahi banaya"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, bina run banaye score zero hota hai. Ab taar par teen chidiya baithi hain. Teeno udd jaati hain. Taar par kitni chidiya bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... kuch nahi, sab udd gayi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero chidiya bachi; sab udd gayi. Ab ulta gino: teen, do, ek. Iske baad kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... zero? ulta ginte ginte zero aata hai?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Ab batao, nau kaun sa number hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"9... nau matlab nine hota hai na?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau ka number 9 hai. Tumne number ke naam, zero, aur 6 aur 9 ka fark practice kiya. Aaj ke liye bas karein?"},{"who":"child","text":"haan haan, samajh gaya... game khelein?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Main dekhti hoon koi game milta hai kya. Tab tak bolo, zero ke baad kaunsa number aata hai?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.07126,"tokens":48167},"boards":7,"lastMs":3131,"noGame":true,"screen":{"on":"nothing","texts":[],"words":"nothing is on the screen"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s2":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i02","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i11","kind":"retrieval"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Saat aur nau dono numeral se milaye"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s3":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item"